  "body": "<div id=\"editions\"><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Alessandra Rocchetti</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"la\">  <div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"la\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <a id=\"al-interpretive\"><!--0--></a>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] <br id=\"al1-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Valerius\"><span data-text=\"Valerius\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"Valerius\">Valerius</span></span>  <span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Maxumus\"><span data-text=\"Maxumus\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"Maximus\">Maxumus</span></span>  <br id=\"al-interpretive\">[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Robert Crellin</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive-simple-lemmatized\">  <div class=\"textpart\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\"> [<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] <span data-text=\"Valerius\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"Valerius\">Valerius</span>  <span data-text=\"Maxumus\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"Maximus\">Maxumus</span> [<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Alessandra Rocchetti</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"la\"><div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"la\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><a id=\"al-diplomatic\"><!--0--></a>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]<br id=\"al1-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Valerius\"><span data-text=\"Valerius\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"Valerius\">VALERIUS</span></span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Maxumus\"><span data-text=\"Maxumus\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"Maximus\">MAXUMUS</span></span><br id=\"al-diplomatic\">[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]</span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Robert Crellin</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic-simple-lemmatized\"><div class=\"textpart\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\">[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]<span data-text=\"Valerius\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"Valerius\">VALERIUS</span><span data-text=\"Maxumus\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"Maximus\">MAXUMUS</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]</span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div></div>  <div id=\"facsimile-images\"><h2>Facsimile Images</h2></div>  <div id=\"apparatus\"><h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span>  <span>text of Maggiore</span>  </span></li></ul></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>Italian translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5677-4679\">Alessandra Rocchetti</a></p>  <p>Valerio Massimo</p>  </div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>English translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5677-4679\">Alessandra Rocchetti</a></p>  <p>Valerius Maximus</p>  </div>  <div id=\"commentary\"><h2>commentary</h2>  <p>CIL merely reports the fleeting report of Niccolo Maggiore that the text including the words Valerius Maxumus was found in Corleone in the 18th century (and notes a second referencing a Pompeius)</p>  </div>  <div id=\"bibliography\"><h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li> Maggiore 1825 94 n.20 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002466\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002466</a>  </li><li> Mommsen 1883 <a href=\"http://arachne.uni-koeln.de/books/CILv10pII1883\" target=\"_blank\">7199</a>  <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000589\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000589</a>  </li></ul>  <ul><li></li></ul>  </div>  <div id=\"handnote\"> Line 1    Interlineation line 1 to 2    </div><div id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence.  </div>",
